660
00:47:23,966 --> 00:47:25,092
[Gyeong-rok] <i>Mi-jeong…</i>

661
00:47:27,261 --> 00:47:30,180
<i>I always thought</i>
<i>I was the only real one in the world.</i>

662
00:47:31,265 --> 00:47:33,267
