666
00:47:44,903 --> 00:47:46,613
<i>But when I'm with you,</i>

667
00:47:47,656 --> 00:47:50,742
<i>I feel with every fiber of my being</i>
<i>that </i>we <i>are real.</i>

668
00:47:54,496 --> 00:47:55,539
I like you a lot.

669
